flowchart LR

    Client["HTTP client<br/>(curl, integration tests)"]:::client -->|"HTTP/JSON"| Api

    subgraph Host ["AuctionServer.Api - one process, Kestrel, http://localhost:5244"]
        Api["Program.cs<br/>JwtBearer + ApiKey schemes, policies Bot / BotProvisioning,<br/>GlobalExceptionHandler, InProcessEventPublisher"]:::host
        Identity["Modules.Identity<br/>/api/users"]:::identity
        Wallets["Modules.Wallets<br/>/api/wallets"]:::wallets
        Auctions["Modules.Auctions<br/>/api/auctions"]:::auctions
        Inventory["Modules.Inventory<br/>/api/inventory"]:::inventory
        Api --> Identity & Wallets & Auctions & Inventory
    end

    Identity & Wallets & Auctions & Inventory --> Db[("PostgreSQL<br/>one database, 11 tables<br/>EF Core via Npgsql, Dapper reads in Auctions")]:::db

    Frontend["Angular frontend<br/>(planned)"]:::planned -.-> Gateway["API gateway<br/>(planned)"]:::planned
    Gateway -.-> Api
    Bots["AI bots, Python<br/>(planned)"]:::planned -.-> Gateway
    Broker["RabbitMQ<br/>(planned event transport)"]:::planned -.->|"market events"| Bots
    Api -.->|"IIntegrationEventPublisher<br/>(in-process today)"| Broker

